- Clone/access:
  - git_url (string), ssh_url (string), clone_url (string), svn_url (string), mirror_url (string, nullable), homepage (string, nullable)
- Language and stats:
  - language (string, nullable), size (integer, KB), forks_count (integer), stargazers_count (integer), watchers_count (integer), open_issues_count (integer), topics (array[string])
- Settings/capabilities:
  - is_template (boolean), has_issues (boolean), has_projects (boolean), has_wiki (boolean), has_pages (boolean), has_downloads (boolean), has_discussions (boolean), archived (boolean), disabled (boolean), allow_forking (boolean), web_commit_signoff_required (boolean)
- Timestamps (nullable ISO 8601):
  - pushed_at, created_at, updated_at
- Permissions:
  - permissions object: admin (boolean), maintain (boolean), push (boolean), triage (boolean), pull (boolean)
  - role_name (string, e.g., “admin”)
- Additional fields:
