Flagship, highest-collaboration potential (core ML)
1) NeurIPS 2025 — Annual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems
- When/where: Dec 2–7, 2025 (6 days), San Diego, USA
- Why it matters: largest annual ML meeting; dozens of co-located workshops and posters foster collaboration
- Evidence: WikiCFP listing with dates/location and deadline: “Dec 2–7, 2025; San Diego; deadline May 14, 2025 (May 11, 2025)” — link: http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=182647&copyownerid=163282
