  • EWM 2025 — Workshop on Embodied World Models for Decision Making, Dec 6–7, 2025; San Diego Convention Center; link: http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=189290&copyownerid=194387
  • COML’25 — Workshop on Constrained Optimization for Machine Learning, Dec 6–7, 2025; San Diego, CA; link: http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=188939&copyownerid=176795
  • Regulatable ML @ NeurIPS 2025 — Dec 6, 2025; San Diego; link: http://www.wikicfp.com/cfp/servlet/event.showcfp?eventid=191040&copyownerid=176795
