Quick decision heuristics (pick based on your research goals)
- If you can only do one in early December and want maximum collaborations: NeurIPS (San Diego, Dec 2–7) + attend targeted workshops on Dec 6–7.
- If Asia-based or building Asia partnerships: ACML (Taipei, Dec 9–12); then optionally NLPIR (Fukuoka, Dec 12–14).
- If your project is NLP-centric and you want smaller, focused venues: NLPTA (Sydney, Dec 20–21) or NLPIR (Fukuoka, Dec 12–14).
- If you’re in multimedia/vision: ICSM (Paris, Dec 19–21) and DPPR (Sydney, Dec 20–21).
- If you need low-friction remote exposure: choose one of the 3 virtual events on Dec 18–19 and schedule 1:1s with prospective collaborators.

