## Interceptors on Custom Instances

### Description
Interceptors can be added to custom instances of Axios created with `axios.create()`.

### Method
`instance.interceptors.request.use(...)` or `instance.interceptors.response.use(...)`

### Parameters
(Same parameters as global interceptors, but applied to the specific instance)

### Request Example
```javascript
// Create a custom instance
const instance = axios.create({
  baseURL: 'https://api.example.com',
  timeout: 1000
});

// Add a request interceptor to the custom instance
instance.interceptors.request.use(function (config) {
  console.log('Custom instance request interceptor:', config.url);
  return config;
}, function (error) {
  return Promise.reject(error);
});

// Add a response interceptor to the custom instance
