- Targets to emphasize (appear in both lists with high placement):
  - ARC Raiders (#2 Top Sellers; Trending)
  - Battlefield 6 (#4; Trending)
  - Where Winds Meet (#5; Trending)
  - Marvel Rivals (#6; Trending)
  - Dispatch (#8; Trending)
  - Risk of Rain 2 + Alloyed Collective DLC (#9 and #23; both Trending)
- Tactics:
  - Run creative variants highlighting recent updates/features and bundle/DLC value where applicable (e.g., base + DLC for Risk of Rain 2).
  - Add store tags/keywords aligned to each title’s storefront phrasing to improve Steam discovery (backed by their appearance in New & Trending).

2) Use Epic’s weekly free game as a traffic lever (top-of-funnel)
- Why: Time-bound zero-price offer drives weekly spikes. This week: Universe for Sale (free until 2025-12-04T16:00Z).
- Tactics:
  - Social and email reminders with the exact deadline to create urgency (date/time above).
  - Cross-promote adjacent indie or narrative titles while traffic is elevated (e.g., “players who claim ‘Universe for Sale’ might also like [your thematically similar title]”).
