3) Lean into franchises with durable interest and current Top Seller presence
- Evidence: Cyberpunk 2077 base (#7 Top Sellers) and Phantom Liberty (#18) both charting; Ghost of Tsushima Director’s Cut (#13); Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 (#14); Red Dead Redemption 2 (#17).
- Tactics:
  - Bundle or “complete your edition” messaging where applicable.
  - Content that speaks to returning players (mod highlights, performance tips, late-game guides) to reactivate lapsed buyers.

4) Watchlist items with high upside for creator/influencer content
- Battlefield 6, ARC Raiders, Marvel Rivals are charting across both lists and are competitive/multiplayer-forward—prime for creator segments (short-form highlights, squad challenges, “first 10 hours” guides).
- Tie creator drops to specific Steam store pages (links above) and measure assisted wishlists/ATC during the push.

