5) Quality checklist you can enforce (with numbers)
- Size: render at 24 px; provide at least 48×48 px hit area (Material) or 44×44 pt (iOS HIG).
- Contrast: ensure ≥3:1 for icon vs background (WCAG 1.4.11).
- Consistency: strokeWidth=1.5 across stroke icons; one stylistic family for the app.
- Accessibility:
  - Interactive icons must have an accessible name (aria-label or an adjacent text).
  - Decorative icons should be aria-hidden="true".
  - Maintain AA target size (≥24×24 CSS px; WCAG 2.2 SC 2.5.8) and follow platform guidance for comfortable touch.

